{"catalog_version": 1, "point_id": "NP-1", "task_id": "corpus-12-DDP-GCN-NP-1-A-1-zh", "fields": {"claim": "7554e149573e86f7e33e516bdb9aceaa5831d44705fd588c5472e2f8c21701c0", "claim_en": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "technical_features[0]": "1e4af8116be83892185cb783c79b974148c8c6065331d40ef74f1f8a38c0043f", "technical_features[1]": "11b9e5b6a14cf07936fdaed8fd99635dc222c588144104fa22364950d2b8299c"}, "sources": [{"source_id": "S-784f4b73e41f21ba-001", "field": "claim", "field_index": null, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 51, "text": "提出DDP-GCN，将道路之间的距离、方向与位置关系共同纳入图卷积网络，建模交通速度预测中的空间依赖。", "sha256": "7554e149573e86f7e33e516bdb9aceaa5831d44705fd588c5472e2f8c21701c0"}, {"source_id": "S-784f4b73e41f21ba-002", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 0, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 25, "text": "除距离外，显式考虑交通方向与位置关系两类空间依赖。", "sha256": "1e4af8116be83892185cb783c79b974148c8c6065331d40ef74f1f8a38c0043f"}, {"source_id": "S-784f4b73e41f21ba-003", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 1, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 25, "text": "将三种空间关系设计为基本图构件并纳入深度神经网络。", "sha256": "11b9e5b6a14cf07936fdaed8fd99635dc222c588144104fa22364950d2b8299c"}]}